  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">TV-Merch.com is a shop dedicated to sourcing the most unique merchandise from your favorite TV shows.&nbsp; We are a team of fans that love television.&nbsp; TV is a great outlet for channeling our common experiences and processing events that are happening around us.&nbsp; And we love to express our love for our favorite shows by surrounding ourselves with the merchandise that reminds us of how great they are.&nbsp; Whether its sporting shirts, sweaters, pins, or just decorating our homes, we feel that there is a demand for high-quality merchandise that reflects this passionl</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Finding this great merchandise, however, has historically been a challenge.&nbsp; Big box retailers typically have a selection that is very limited and simlar across stores.&nbsp; And online sources are typically no better.&nbsp; Founded in 2024, TV-Merch.com is dedicated to sourcing high-quality merchandise, and curating selections to provide the most unique selection of items.&nbsp; We are also focused on providing merch for not just the most popular shows, but also the 'hidden gems' and cult classics that are not available anywhere else.</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">WE are new to the game, but rapidly expanding our inventory of shows and products. And we are beginning to grow our affiliate network to drive more awareness and traffic to our site.&nbsp; We would love to work with you!</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br></p></div>",
